{"aliases": ["close up", "近景构图", "特写构图"], "applicable_path": "composition.framing", "candidate_value": "close_up", "conditions": [{"operator": "equals", "path": "subject.count", "values": ["1"]}, {"operator": "in", "path": "style.primary", "values": ["cinematic", "photorealistic"]}], "content": "当主体数量被确认为 1，且风格为 cinematic 或 photorealistic 时，构图优先选择 close_up：单主体近景能提高面部与关键细节的像素占比、减少背景干扰，适合强调人物情绪或材质。建议仅在 composition.framing 为用户委托、未 PIN 且无 active Realization 时提出；用户已明确构图时不得覆盖。close_up 与镜头焦段、模型实际渲染能力无绑定关系，不承诺画质提升。", "content_hash": "c155a5095c14d78cd5396ac654a3d4b68cc0158b64682cb62b35a80b33a0334b", "keywords": ["单主体", "近景", "特写", "人物情绪", "close-up", "single subject", "portrait crop"], "knowledge_id": "composition.framing.close_up_for_single_subject", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "composition.framing.close_up_for_single_subject", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/composition.framing.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：单主体近景优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
{"aliases": ["wide angle", "全景构图"], "applicable_path": "composition.framing", "candidate_value": "wide_shot", "conditions": [{"operator": "equals", "path": "environment.mode", "values": ["outdoor"]}], "content": "当环境被确认为 outdoor 时，构图优先选择 wide_shot：广角取景能同时容纳主体与场景关系，使地点特征成为画面信息的一部分，适合需要交代环境的委托。建议仅在 composition.framing 为用户委托、未 PIN 且无 active Realization 时提出；用户明确的构图或近景需求优先。wide_shot 不规定具体焦段或主体占比，属于候选值层面的场景匹配启发式。", "content_hash": "d30261281ba0b9fd9f6883c7fb2f256fd81883bf09280b6b0156764ec8e9a099", "keywords": ["广角", "远景", "环境交代", "地点", "wide shot", "establishing", "outdoor"], "knowledge_id": "composition.framing.wide_shot_for_outdoor_context", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "composition.framing.wide_shot_for_outdoor_context", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/composition.framing.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：户外环境交代的广角优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
{"aliases": ["medium framing", "中景构图"], "applicable_path": "composition.framing", "candidate_value": "medium_shot", "conditions": [{"operator": "in", "path": "subject.pose_action", "values": ["standing", "walking"]}, {"operator": "equals", "path": "environment.mode", "values": ["studio"]}], "content": "当姿态被确认为 standing 或 walking，且环境为 studio 时，构图优先选择 medium_shot：中景能在保留人物完整动作轮廓的同时维持主体画面占比，避免近景裁掉肢体动作、远景削弱姿态可读性。建议仅在 composition.framing 为用户委托、未 PIN 且无 active Realization 时提出；用户已明确的构图与 PIN 优先。medium_shot 是启发式候选排序，不保证动作表达效果。", "content_hash": "fc4d2f0e5f7a9169856fd4873cb720c93c1deeca88ebb9e215aa068ef91a9536", "keywords": ["中景", "站姿", "行走", "动作轮廓", "medium shot", "standing", "walking"], "knowledge_id": "composition.framing.medium_shot_for_standing_pose", "review_status": "draft", "reviewed_at": null, "reviewer": null, "source": {"license": "internal-project-original", "locator": "composition.framing.medium_shot_for_standing_pose", "original_declaration": "本项目原创领域启发式规则，未复制第三方文本；作为待人工审核的 draft 交付，不声称已核实任何模型官方能力。", "repository_path": "knowledge_base/v0.4/composition.framing.jsonl", "source_date": null, "source_revision": "v0.4-draft-1", "source_type": "project_original", "title": "领域规则：站姿动作的中景优先（项目原创）", "url": null}, "target_models": ["any"], "version": "1"}
